# Legion is an audit engine: sealed receipts and qualification books hash file
# BYTES. Any platform-dependent line-ending conversion changes those digests and
# makes evidence unverifiable off the machine that sealed it (observed: books
# sealed on Windows failed digest checks on Linux/macOS CI).
#
# Therefore: git performs NO eol conversion anywhere in this repo. Worktree bytes
# always equal blob bytes, on every platform.
* -text
